message: >-
  If you use this Lean formalization, please cite both this repository and the
  First Proof Second Batch report; Problem 6 was contributed by Joshua Evan
  Greene and Duncan McCoy.
title: Positive-Definite Tree Lattices in Lean
type: software
authors:
  - name: IIIS Lean
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of First Proof Second Batch Problem 6: a
  positive-definite integer-weighted finite tree with a unique underweighted
  vertex has an irreducible vertex vector.
